# E01-S028 — keeps the build context small and correct: `node_modules`
# holds platform-specific native bindings (better-sqlite3) built for the
# HOST, not the container, so it must be reinstalled inside the image, not
# copied in. Every Dockerfile under infra/docker/ builds from the repo root
# as its context (see their own header comments for why).
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
data
